MoBetta: mtld3d: Default the log directory to %LOCALAPPDATA%\mtld3d-logs.

athei/mtld3d v0.15.1 (9919759) writes its log to mtld3d-logs beside the
executable when log.dir is empty, both for the log Direct3DCreate9 opens
and for the early location a crash before it reports to. Beside Wow.exe
is the game folder (MoBetta constraint 1). Our wrapper set log.dir through
MTLD3D_CONFIG in user.reg, which a packaged engine cannot carry.

The default moves to the prefix's own AppData\Local, in both places, so it
is not a profile key: the early location is derived at load, before any
config or profile is read. Without LOCALAPPDATA there is no default and
the log goes to stderr rather than to the executable's directory. A
log.dir set in mtld3d.conf or MTLD3D_CONFIG still wins.

